<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fannie Mae, Freddie Mac cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fannie Mae, Freddie Mac cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Fannie Mae and Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac) to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
